
-- fact-master.pgm - Knowledge & Information Management Component
-- Essential component for handling factual information, trivia, and educational content
-- Covers knowledge sharing, fact checking, learning support, and informational queries

-- Knowledge Requests
Recognizer "tell me about"
	Remember "User wants information about something"
	Option Say "I'd love to share what I know! What would you like to learn about?"
	Option Say "Knowledge is fascinating! What topic interests you?"

Recognizer "what is"
	Remember "User asked what something is"
	Option Say "That's a great question! What specifically would you like me to explain?"
	Option Say "I enjoy explaining things! What are you curious about?"

Recognizer "explain"
	Remember "User wants explanation"
	Option Say "I'm happy to explain! What needs clarification?"
	Option Say "Explanations are my specialty! What would you like me to break down?"

Recognizer "how does"
	Remember "User asked how something works"
	Option Say "Understanding how things work is so satisfying! What mechanism are you curious about?"
	Option Say "Great question about processes! What would you like me to explain?"

Recognizer "why does"
	Remember "User asked why something happens"
	Option Say "The 'why' behind things is often the most interesting part! What are you wondering about?"
	Option Say "Excellent question! Understanding reasons helps us learn. What's puzzling you?"

-- Educational Content
Recognizer "teach me"
	Remember "User wants to learn"
	Option Say "I love helping people learn! What subject interests you most?"
	Option Say "Learning together is wonderful! What would you like to explore?"

Recognizer "learn about"
	Remember "User wants to learn about topic"
	Option Say "Learning is such a rewarding journey! What topic calls to you?"
	Option Say "Knowledge opens so many doors! What area would you like to explore?"

Recognizer "I want to understand"
	Remember "User seeks understanding"
	Option Say "Understanding is the foundation of wisdom! What concept interests you?"
	Option Say "I admire your curiosity! What would help deepen your understanding?"

-- Trivia & Fun Facts
Recognizer "fun fact"
	Remember "User wants fun fact"
	Option Say "Fun facts make learning enjoyable! What kind of facts interest you most?"
	Option Say "I love sharing interesting facts! Any particular topic you're curious about?"

Recognizer "did you know"
	Remember "User shared or wants trivia"
	Option Say "I love learning new things! What fascinating fact are you thinking of?"
	Option Say "Did-you-know facts are the best! What's caught your attention?"

Recognizer "interesting"
	Remember "User finds something interesting"
	Option Say "Interest is the spark of learning! What's captured your curiosity?"
	Option Say "When something interests us, we learn it best! Tell me more."

Recognizer "fascinating"
	Remember "User is fascinated"
	Option Say "Fascination is such a wonderful feeling! What's sparked that response?"
	Option Say "The world is full of fascinating things! What's caught your interest?"

-- Research & Information Gathering
Recognizer "research"
	Remember "User mentions research"
	Option Say "Research opens up new worlds of knowledge! What are you investigating?"
	Option Say "Good research skills are invaluable! What topic are you exploring?"

Recognizer "find out"
	Remember "User wants to find information"
	Option Say "Discovering information is like treasure hunting! What are you looking for?"
	Option Say "I love the thrill of finding answers! What information do you need?"

Recognizer "look up"
	Remember "User wants to look something up"
	Option Say "Looking things up shows great curiosity! What would you like to investigate?"
	Option Say "Reference checking is so important! What needs verification?"

