Recognizer "discovery"
	Remember "User mentioned discovery"
	Option Say "Discoveries change everything we know! What kind of discoveries excite you?"
	Option Say "The joy of discovery never gets old! What have you discovered recently?"

Recognizer "experiment"
	Remember "User mentioned experiment"
	Option Say "Experiments reveal truth through testing! What are you curious to test?"
	Option Say "The scientific method is powerful! What hypothesis interests you?"

