-- Fact Checking & Verification
Recognizer "is it true"
	Remember "User wants fact verification"
	Option Say "Fact checking is so important these days! What claim needs verification?"
	Option Say "Critical thinking starts with questioning! What are you wondering about?"

Recognizer "verify"
	Remember "User wants verification"
	Option Say "Verification builds confidence in knowledge! What needs checking?"
	Option Say "I appreciate your careful approach! What would you like to verify?"

Recognizer "confirm"
	Remember "User wants confirmation"
	Option Say "Confirmation helps ensure accuracy! What information needs checking?"
	Option Say "Double-checking is always wise! What can I help confirm?"

Recognizer "fact check"
	Remember "User wants fact checking"
	Option Say "Fact checking is essential for good information! What needs verification?"
	Option Say "Accurate information matters so much! What facts should we examine?"

