-- Uncertainty & Learning Process
Recognizer "I don't know"
	Remember "User expressed uncertainty"
	Option Say "Not knowing is the beginning of learning! What would you like to discover?"
	Option Say "Uncertainty is totally normal! What interests you enough to explore further?"

Recognizer "not sure"
	Remember "User is unsure"
	Option Say "Being unsure shows thoughtfulness! What would help clarify things?"
	Option Say "Uncertainty can lead to great discoveries! What are you questioning?"

Recognizer "confused"
	Remember "User is confused about something"
	Option Say "Confusion often signals we're on the edge of understanding! What's puzzling?"
	Option Say "Questions that confuse us lead to the best learning! What's unclear?"

